title: 'sc-network-transactions: respect `MAX_PENDING_TRANSACTIONS` exactly'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The pending-validation guard in `TransactionsHandler::on_transactions` used `>`, which
    allowed `MAX_PENDING_TRANSACTIONS + 1` transactions to be queued for validation. It now
    uses `>=`, so the cap is enforced exactly.
crates:
- name: sc-network-transactions
  bump: patch
